system materials used.[  Provide manually operated household cooking gas appliance valves conforming to <RID>ANSI Z21.1/CSA 1.1</RID>
 and <RID>ANSI Z21.15/CSA 9.1</RID>.]</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
[<SPT><TTL>Valves<MET> 65 mm</MET><ENG> 2-1/2 Inches</ENG> and Larger</TTL><BRK/>
